    <string name="terms_dialog_close_btn">Close</string>
    <string name="terms_dialog_body">1. Purpose of the Service\nCraveWallet is a personal finance application designed to help users track recurring subscriptions (in PEN, USD, and EUR) and delivery expenses, manage monthly budgets, and receive timely billing reminders. CraveWallet does not connect to bank accounts or payment cards; all records are entered by the user.\n\n2. Plans and Payments (CraveWallet Premium)\nThe free plan allows tracking up to 5 active subscriptions. CraveWallet Premium costs S/ 9.99 per month and unlocks unlimited subscriptions and spending analytics. Payments are processed securely through Mercado Pago. You may cancel your subscription renewal at any time from your Profile; Premium access remains active until the end of the current paid billing period.\n\n3. Data Stored and Privacy\nWhen you use a connected account, your email address, subscriptions, delivery expenses, and membership status are stored on the server associated with your account. Notes and reminder preferences are stored locally on your device. In offline demo mode, all data remains exclusively on your device.\n\n4. Device Permissions (Calendar and Notifications)\n• Calendar (READ_CALENDAR / WRITE_CALENDAR): Used solely to create or update reminder events before each subscription charge in your primary or local CraveWallet calendar. CraveWallet never reads, modifies, or deletes your personal calendar events.\n• Notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS): Used exclusively to send local push alerts before upcoming charges according to your configured lead time.\n\n5. Ethical Commitment (ACM/IEEE &amp; CIP Principles)\nIn accordance with the ACM/IEEE Software Engineering Code of Ethics and the Code of Ethics of the Colegio de Ingenieros del Perú (CIP), CraveWallet commits to:\n• Privacy and Confidentiality: Protecting user information using encrypted transport (HTTPS) and minimum necessary permissions.\n• Honesty and Transparency: Clearly communicating exchange rate sources, membership pricing, and prototype/service limitations without hidden fees.\n• No Sale of Personal Data: Never selling, renting, or sharing personal or financial records with third-party advertisers or data brokers.\n• User Autonomy and Account Deletion: Allowing users to export, modify, or request complete deletion of their account and associated data at any time.\n\n6. Contact and Support\nResponsible entity: [COMPLETAR: Nombre del equipo o titular del proyecto]\nContact email: [COMPLETAR: correo de soporte y privacidad]\nAddress / Academic Institution: [COMPLETAR: Universidad / Dirección]</string>

